  "articleBody": "Start a whole-house renovation by documenting the home’s condition, setting priorities, establishing a realistic project budget, and hiring a team that can coordinate design, permitting, and construction. In San Diego County, the responsible jurisdiction may be the City of San Diego, another city, or the unincorporated county, so permit responsibilities should be identified before construction begins.",
